# Scratch renders from iteration are regenerable with `node src/render.mjs`
# and are not worth versioning.
out/_*.png
out/.raster_*.png
out/*FOLD_ORDER_CHECK.png

# The approved previews and fold mockups ARE deliverables and DO belong in
# version control. An earlier blanket `out/*.png` rule silently excluded them
# from a hand-off bundle — the artefacts were on disk and absent from history.
